{"id": "sevt_01F93HqSD5hcYyvnp16sesaR", "content": [{"text": "The log confirms it: the single-row `SELECT * FROM sku_prices WHERE sku_id = ?` query appears thousands of times, starting right at 14:43 when the deploy landed \u2014 none of this pattern before then.\n\n**Evidence**\n- cart p99 flat at ~75ms through 14:42, jumps to ~3,700\u20134,600ms starting 14:43.\n- Deploy `df06e76` (cart, \"price cart lines individually\") landed 14:43:20 \u2014 exact alignment.\n- Diff replaced a single batched `SkuPrice.objects.filter(sku_id__in=ids)` with a per-line `filter(sku_id=line.sku_id)` inside a loop \u2014 an N+1 query.\n- Log shows the per-row query firing 76\u219273\u2192129 times/min beginning at 14:43, absent before.\n- Other deploys don't fit: checkout `346f34d` (14:41, logging-only) and auth `e8f9711` (14:44, after the spike began).\n\n> **Root cause:** `df06e76` \u2014 refactor replaced a single batched SKU price lookup with a per-cart-line query, creating an N+1 that drove cart p99 from ~75ms to ~4s.", "type": "text"}], "processed_at": "2026-10-14T05:47:15.184255Z", "type": "agent.message"}
